+HIS-16 (#237) — containment
+===========================
+
+THE TICKET IS THE HAZARD. DEF-046 happened because an in-process driver
+pinned all four home variables and believed it was sandboxed. So this is
+measured, not assumed, and it asks the MEMBERSHIP question rather than the
+narrower "did it write where it should not" one that missed DEF-047.
+
+1. BEFORE/AFTER over the three homes named in the assignment — the root home,
