+V4b  the membership law stops reading orphaned .projections.json records
+    mutation: HomeMembershipLaw.installedRecords: the .projections.json arm returns without recording the name
+    expected to redden: ['the_detector_flags_a_planted_gain_and_a_planted_loss']
+    ACTUALLY reddened:  ['the_detector_flags_a_planted_gain_and_a_planted_loss']
+    verdict: the claim reddened, and only the claim
+    That reader is the one DEF-047 turned on: deploy-helm vanished from skills/ and ONLY its .projections.json survived, orphaned. The self-test plants that exact residue.
