+      at_least_one_home_was_actually_checked:              failed   <- the claim
+      every_home_holds_exactly_what_was_installed_into_it: passed   (vacuously true)
+      the_detector_flags_a_planted_gain_and_a_planted_loss: passed
+    CORRECTED after review of #241, M4: this row previously quoted the
